        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 65752, Classic Narrow Backset Mortise Lockset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe classic design of the 65752 Omnia Narrow Backset Lockset makes it easy to add both style and functionality to any door in your home. It will look great amid almost any decor from period-style homes to modern day styles and since the backplate and the handle are both made of solid brass, it will last for a very long time. This Narrow Backset Mortise Lockset is designed to fit doors with backsets of either 1-1/2\" or 2\". It is available in 4 finishes in a wide array of functions including standard single cylinder, passage, and double cylinder entry.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Also Available Matching <a href=\"/products/simple-door-lever-latchset-omnia-752-00\"><b>Simple Door Lever</b></a></p>\r\n\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Narrow Backset Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>ADA compliant.</li>\r\n<li>Made of solid brass with a heavy gauge plated steel case.</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass 1/2\" lachbolt and 1\" deadbolt</li>\r\n<li>Schlage \"C\" keyway (for key functions).</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Traditional Mortise Lockset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Backplate Length: 9-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backplate Width: 1-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Backplate Projection: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\" or 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: either 1-1/2\" or 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike: solid brass curved lip strike: 4-7/8\" x 1-1/4\" x lip 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt: 1/2\" x 3/4\" x 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Latchbolt: 1/2\" x 1\" x 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Case:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>1-1/2\" backset: 6-1/16\" x 2-5/16\" x 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>2\" backset: 6-1/16\" x 2-13/16\" x 3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/OMN_narrow_bs_mortise_dimentions.pdf?v=1704262277\" target=\"new\"><b>Narrow Backset Mortise Lock Specification Diagram</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Classic Narrow Backset Handleset, Omnia 65752",
                "description": "Omnia 65752 Traditional Narrow Backset Handleset - The classic design of the 65752 Omnia Narrow Backset Lockset makes it easy to add both style and functionality to any door in your home. It will look great amid almost any decor from period-style homes to modern day styles and since the backplate and the handle are both made of solid brass, it will last for a very long time. This Narrow Backset Mortise Lockset is designed to fit doors with backsets of either 1-1/2 inches or 2 inches. It is available in 4 finishes in a wide array of functions including standard single cylinder, passage, and double cylinder entry.",
                "keywords": "small backset locksets, omnia narrow backset mortise locks, single cylinder handlesets, double cylinder handlesets, OMN-65752, Omnia 65752, Traditional Narrow Backset Handlesets, Classic Narrow Backset Mortise Locksets, narrow backset handlesets, Classic handlesets, Traditional handlesets, Classic entrance sets, Classic mortise entrancesets, Classic front door handles,"
